{"id": "cc-01", "kind": "cc", "question": "这一段说亚马逊原住民把电鳗叫什么？", "criterion": "按字幕答 POOCU 或引用后面的使人昏睡的称呼。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 25.46, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:16", "start": 23.76, "text": "亚马逊原住民更有诗意", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r2": {"end": 26.96, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:17", "start": 25.46, "text": "他们把它叫做POOCU", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r3": {"end": 28.0, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:18", "start": 26.96, "text": "使人昏睡的语", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r4": {"end": 29.28, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:19", "start": 28.0, "text": "简称催眠语", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r5": {"end": 30.48, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:20", "start": 29.28, "text": "一摸就入睡", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r6": {"end": 31.439, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:21", "start": 30.48, "text": "效果拔群", "cid": "43200679218"}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"reply_public\",\n  \"reason\": \"specific_detail\",\n  \"text\": \"亚马逊原住民的电鳗叫POOCU，简称催眠语。它使人昏睡，效果拔群。\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"r2\",\n    \"r4\"\n  ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 78, "prompt_tokens": 1210, "total_tokens": 1288, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.463, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "亚马逊原住民的电鳗叫POOCU，简称催眠语。它使人昏睡，效果拔群。", "evidence_ids": ["r2", "r4"]}}
{"id": "cc-02", "kind": "cc", "question": "字幕说这些螃蟹总共花了多少？", "criterion": "答 520，别从题目推算单价。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 24.98, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:18", "start": 23.64, "text": "总共花了520啊", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r2": {"end": 26.14, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:19", "start": 24.98, "text": "今天我就找了一个方法", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r3": {"end": 29.34, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:20", "start": 26.14, "text": "他是说用他这个方法做出来的盘锦河蟹啊", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r4": {"end": 30.1, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:21", "start": 29.34, "text": "味道特别好吃", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r5": {"end": 31.66, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:22", "start": 30.1, "text": "就是跟我们以前做的方法都不一样嘛", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r6": {"end": 33.26, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:23", "start": 31.66, "text": "我们以前做的都是那种香辣的味道", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r7": {"end": 34.34, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:24", "start": 33.26, "text": "正好不是有300多只嘛", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r8": {"end": 35.3, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:25", "start": 34.34, "text": "然后我们就做两个做法", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r9": {"end": 36.42, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:26", "start": 35.3, "text": "香辣的就飞过来做", "cid": "43303305709"}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"reply_public\",\n  \"reason\": \"specific_detail\",\n  \"text\": \"总共520元。\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"r1\",\n    \"r2\",\n    \"r3\",\n    \"r4\"\n  ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 71, "prompt_tokens": 1289, "total_tokens": 1360, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.598, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "总共520元。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4"]}}
{"id": "cc-03", "kind": "cc", "question": "第一个路由失败时怎么处理？用户看到的模型 ID 有几个？", "criterion": "自动降级到下一项，仍只看到一个模型 ID。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 39.92, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:18", "start": 38.42, "text": "一条路由层层兜底", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r2": {"end": 43.28, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:19", "start": 39.92, "text": "第一个失败自动降级为下一个对象层", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r3": {"end": 45.51, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:20", "start": 43.28, "text": "永远只有一个模型id", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r4": {"end": 46.73, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:21", "start": 45.51, "text": "放心好用", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r5": {"end": 47.45, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:22", "start": 46.73, "text": "用了多少", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r6": {"end": 48.35, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:23", "start": 47.45, "text": "一清二楚", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r7": {"end": 50.25, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:24", "start": 48.35, "text": "数据面板加运行日志", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r8": {"end": 51.37, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:25", "start": 50.25, "text": "失败可查", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r9": {"end": 53.36, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:26", "start": 51.37, "text": "每条可查", "cid": "42645980626"}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"reply_public\",\n  \"reason\": \"specific_detail\",\n  \"text\": \"第一个失败时自动降级为下一个对象层。模型 ID 只有一个。\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"r3\",\n    \"r9\"\n  ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 68, "prompt_tokens": 1277, "total_tokens": 1345, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.368, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "第一个失败时自动降级为下一个对象层。模型 ID 只有一个。", "evidence_ids": ["r3", "r9"]}}
{"id": "cc-04", "kind": "cc", "question": "字幕里他们抱怨对面的菜为什么不好拿？", "criterion": "因为离得远、不好够到。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 53.24, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:17", "start": 52.12, "text": "我这边实在没有了", "cid": "43146348789"}, "r2": {"end": 54.04, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:18", "start": 53.24, "text": "啥也没有", "cid": "43146348789"}, "r3": {"end": 55.16, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:19", "start": 54.04, "text": "啥都吃不着", "cid": "43146348789"}, "r4": {"end": 56.28, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:20", "start": 55.16, "text": "对面还有点远", "cid": "43146348789"}, "r5": {"end": 57.3, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:21", "start": 56.28, "text": "还不好够", "cid": "43146348789"}, "r6": {"end": 59.4, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:22", "start": 57.3, "text": "我也是上次我都忘了", "cid": "43146348789"}, "r7": {"end": 60.74, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:23", "start": 59.4, "text": "这是麻辣的牛肉吗", "cid": "43146348789"}, "r8": {"end": 65.459, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:24", "start": 60.74, "text": "哦我几天牛肉来两块吧", "cid": "43146348789"}, "r9": {"end": 69.03, "id": "43146348789:2139992393255444480:25", "start": 67.179, "text": "加一个", "cid": "43146348789"}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"wait\",\n  \"reason\": \"insufficient_evidence\",\n  \"text\": \"\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 1270, "total_tokens": 1313, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 1.473, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "wait", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "text": "", "evidence_ids": []}}
{"id": "cc-05", "kind": "cc", "question": "他给这次跑步定的天数和每日距离是多少？", "criterion": "连续目标 100 天，每天 3 km，勿编造成果。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 32.78, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:22", "start": 31.72, "text": "之前我也跑过", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r2": {"end": 33.86, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:23", "start": 32.78, "text": "而且不止一次", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r3": {"end": 36.6, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:24", "start": 33.86, "text": "只不过每一次都是跑了几天就不了了", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r4": {"end": 40.3, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:25", "start": 36.6, "text": "之所以这次我决定无论如何都要跑够100天", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r5": {"end": 41.24, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:26", "start": 40.3, "text": "每天3km", "cid": "43209985991"}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"reply_public\",\n  \"reason\": \"specific_detail\",\n  \"text\": \"他给这次跑步定的天数是100天，每日距离3km。\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"r5\",\n    \"r4\"\n  ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 70, "prompt_tokens": 1195, "total_tokens": 1265, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.102, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "他给这次跑步定的天数是100天，每日距离3km。", "evidence_ids": ["r5", "r4"]}}
{"id": "cc-06", "kind": "cc", "question": "字幕把什么无生命的东西说成会跳舞？", "criterion": "帐篷，理解为比喻或搞笑旁白。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 52.08, "id": "43216211122:2141717002912826112:15", "start": 47.699, "text": "你看这位舞者用肾上腺素跳出来的绝望舞步", "cid": "43216211122"}, "r2": {"end": 55.46, "id": "43216211122:2141717002912826112:16", "start": 52.08, "text": "让人看到了五秒内街舞大成", "cid": "43216211122"}, "r3": {"end": 62.36, "id": "43216211122:2141717002912826112:17", "start": 57.76, "text": "而这一位更是证明了互联网上万事皆有可能", "cid": "43216211122"}, "r4": {"end": 66.46, "id": "43216211122:2141717002912826112:18", "start": 62.36, "text": "你甚至能看到一个绝望的帐篷在跳舞", "cid": "43216211122"}, "r5": {"end": 74.78, "id": "43216211122:2141717002912826112:19", "start": 72.7, "text": "还有这位冰面行者", "cid": "43216211122"}, "r6": {"end": 75.92, "id": "43216211122:2141717002912826112:20", "start": 74.78, "text": "不出手则已", "cid": "43216211122"}}, "text": "{\"action\": \"wait\", \"reason\": \"insufficient_evidence\", \"text\": \"\", \"evidence_ids\": []}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 30, "prompt_tokens": 1234, "total_tokens": 1264, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 1.186, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "wait", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "text": "", "evidence_ids": []}}
{"id": "cc-07", "kind": "cc", "question": "对方说只努力还不够，要看到什么？", "criterion": "要看到结果。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 62.06, "id": "43289478812:2143711561012159744:18", "start": 58.97, "text": "那个时候我觉得自己无所不能", "cid": "43289478812"}, "r2": {"end": 65.26, "id": "43289478812:2143711561012159744:19", "start": 62.5, "text": "但是三天做个方案工作的事情", "cid": "43289478812"}, "r3": {"end": 67.18, "id": "43289478812:2143711561012159744:20", "start": 65.26, "text": "假推荐一件事情的核心打法", "cid": "43289478812"}, "r4": {"end": 68.38, "id": "43289478812:2143711561012159744:21", "start": 67.18, "text": "我要看到结果", "cid": "43289478812"}, "r5": {"end": 70.43, "id": "43289478812:2143711561012159744:22", "start": 68.38, "text": "我真的已经很努力了", "cid": "43289478812"}, "r6": {"end": 71.47, "id": "43289478812:2143711561012159744:23", "start": 70.43, "text": "是很努力", "cid": "43289478812"}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"wait\",\n  \"reason\": \"insufficient_evidence\",\n  \"text\": \"\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 1211, "total_tokens": 1251, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 1.37, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "wait", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "text": "", "evidence_ids": []}}
{"id": "cc-08", "kind": "cc", "question": "它根据互动会更倾向看哪类视频？", "criterion": "倾向观看对方感兴趣或喜欢的类型。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 47.279, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:18", "start": 45.019, "text": "也就是他分享给你的视频", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r2": {"end": 49.659, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:19", "start": 47.279, "text": "你有没有去看他艾特你的评论呢", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r3": {"end": 50.299, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:20", "start": 49.659, "text": "你有没有回", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r4": {"end": 52.139, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:21", "start": 50.299, "text": "或者他有没有给他评论点赞", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r5": {"end": 54.9, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:22", "start": 52.139, "text": "来调整他看视频的策略", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r6": {"end": 57.32, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:23", "start": 54.9, "text": "他会更加倾向于去看你感兴趣的", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r7": {"end": 58.94, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:24", "start": 57.32, "text": "或者说你喜欢的那种视频啊", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r8": {"end": 60.75, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:25", "start": 58.94, "text": "用来迎合你的喜好嘛", "cid": "42838132685"}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"wait\",\n  \"reason\": \"insufficient_evidence\",\n  \"text\": \"\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 1271, "total_tokens": 1311, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 1.4, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "wait", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "text": "", "evidence_ids": []}}
{"id": "cc-09", "kind": "cc", "question": "字幕说低预算装机为何偏向 DDR4？", "criterion": "同容量 DDR4 显著便宜于 DDR5，限定为视频中的说法。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 35.14, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:18", "start": 33.14, "text": "就是被D5内存的价格拖了后腿", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r2": {"end": 36.6, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:19", "start": 35.14, "text": "虽然内存开始涨价以来", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r3": {"end": 38.28, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:20", "start": 36.6, "text": "不管是DDR4还是DDR5", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r4": {"end": 39.96, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:21", "start": 38.28, "text": "都是一个持续发癫状态", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r5": {"end": 41.48, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:22", "start": 39.96, "text": "涨幅都高达百分之几百", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r6": {"end": 42.32, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:23", "start": 41.48, "text": "但总的来说", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r7": {"end": 45.46, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:24", "start": 42.32, "text": "DDR4的同容量价格还是显著低于DDR5", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r8": {"end": 47.14, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:25", "start": 45.46, "text": "这也是大家低预算装机时", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r9": {"end": 49.08, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:26", "start": 47.14, "text": "更倾向于选择D4平台的原因", "cid": "38875041001"}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"reply_public\",\n  \"reason\": \"specific_detail\",\n  \"text\": \"低预算装机更倾向 DDR4，因为同容量价格显著低于 DDR5。\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"r7\",\n    \"r9\"\n  ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 70, "prompt_tokens": 1291, "total_tokens": 1361, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.193, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "低预算装机更倾向 DDR4，因为同容量价格显著低于 DDR5。", "evidence_ids": ["r7", "r9"]}}
{"id": "cc-10", "kind": "cc", "question": "字幕里家里还缺什么？", "criterion": "几个大箱子和一块麦田。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 30.62, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:12", "start": 29.12, "text": "头胸腿靴都是钻石的", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r2": {"end": 32.54, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:13", "start": 30.62, "text": "家里还差几个大箱子和一块麦田", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r3": {"end": 34.12, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:14", "start": 32.54, "text": "我先去砍树", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r4": {"end": 46.02, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:15", "start": 43.22, "text": "哎呀卧槽我要回家啊", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r5": {"end": 49.14, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:16", "start": 46.02, "text": "卧槽回来了", "cid": "42956949203"}}, "text": "{\n\"action\": \"reply_public\",\n\"reason\": \"specific_detail\",\n\"text\": \"家里还差几个大箱子和一块麦田。\",\n\"evidence_ids\": [\n  \"r2\",\n  \"r5\"\n]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "prompt_tokens": 1196, "total_tokens": 1254, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.169, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "家里还差几个大箱子和一块麦田。", "evidence_ids": ["r2", "r5"]}}
