{"id": "both-01", "kind": "both", "question": "字幕怎么称呼电鳗？示意图里标记是什么颜色？", "criterion": "POOCU 或字幕中的催眠称呼，加绿色标记。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 25.46, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:16", "start": 23.76, "text": "亚马逊原住民更有诗意", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r2": {"end": 26.96, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:17", "start": 25.46, "text": "他们把它叫做POOCU", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r3": {"end": 28.0, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:18", "start": 26.96, "text": "使人昏睡的语", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r4": {"end": 29.28, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:19", "start": 28.0, "text": "简称催眠语", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r5": {"end": 30.48, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:20", "start": 29.28, "text": "一摸就入睡", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r6": {"end": 31.439, "id": "43200679218:2141404805053277696:21", "start": 30.48, "text": "效果拔群", "cid": "43200679218"}, "r7": {"id": "43200679218:storyboard:11:e1dfa672d8c0b674", "cid": "43200679218", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 66.0, "end": 66.0}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"reply_public\",\n  \"reason\": \"specific_detail\",\n  \"text\": \"电鳗是亚马逊原住民的POOCU，示意图里标记是绿色。\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"r1\",\n    \"r2\",\n    \"r5\"\n  ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 76, "prompt_tokens": 1514, "total_tokens": 1590, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.833, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "电鳗是亚马逊原住民的POOCU，示意图里标记是绿色。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2", "r5"]}}
{"id": "both-02", "kind": "both", "question": "字幕里说总价多少？锅里的东西是下锅前还是已经在烹煮？", "criterion": "520，画面是烹煮中的螃蟹。", "allowed": ["r1", "r10", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 24.98, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:18", "start": 23.64, "text": "总共花了520啊", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r2": {"end": 26.14, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:19", "start": 24.98, "text": "今天我就找了一个方法", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r3": {"end": 29.34, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:20", "start": 26.14, "text": "他是说用他这个方法做出来的盘锦河蟹啊", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r4": {"end": 30.1, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:21", "start": 29.34, "text": "味道特别好吃", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r5": {"end": 31.66, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:22", "start": 30.1, "text": "就是跟我们以前做的方法都不一样嘛", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r6": {"end": 33.26, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:23", "start": 31.66, "text": "我们以前做的都是那种香辣的味道", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r7": {"end": 34.34, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:24", "start": 33.26, "text": "正好不是有300多只嘛", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r8": {"end": 35.3, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:25", "start": 34.34, "text": "然后我们就做两个做法", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r9": {"end": 36.42, "id": "43303305709:2143999418477624832:26", "start": 35.3, "text": "香辣的就飞过来做", "cid": "43303305709"}, "r10": {"id": "43303305709:storyboard:24:129e1c69d97a9f37", "cid": "43303305709", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 122.0, "end": 122.0}}, "text": "{\n\"action\": \"wait\",\n\"reason\": \"insufficient_evidence\",\n\"text\": \"\",\n\"evidence_ids\": []\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 1604, "total_tokens": 1640, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.978, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "wait", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "text": "", "evidence_ids": []}}
{"id": "both-03", "kind": "both", "question": "失败怎么兜底？另外面板截图是浅底还是深底？", "criterion": "自动降级到下一项，第一帧面板浅底。", "allowed": ["r1", "r10", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 39.92, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:18", "start": 38.42, "text": "一条路由层层兜底", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r2": {"end": 43.28, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:19", "start": 39.92, "text": "第一个失败自动降级为下一个对象层", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r3": {"end": 45.51, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:20", "start": 43.28, "text": "永远只有一个模型id", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r4": {"end": 46.73, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:21", "start": 45.51, "text": "放心好用", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r5": {"end": 47.45, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:22", "start": 46.73, "text": "用了多少", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r6": {"end": 48.35, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:23", "start": 47.45, "text": "一清二楚", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r7": {"end": 50.25, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:24", "start": 48.35, "text": "数据面板加运行日志", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r8": {"end": 51.37, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:25", "start": 50.25, "text": "失败可查", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r9": {"end": 53.36, "id": "42645980626:2126923814884520192:26", "start": 51.37, "text": "每条可查", "cid": "42645980626"}, "r10": {"id": "42645980626:storyboard:9:60905887af3294df", "cid": "42645980626", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 50.0, "end": 50.0}}, "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"reply_public\",\n  \"reason\": \"specific_detail\",\n  \"text\": \"浅底，不是深底。\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"r10\"\n  ]\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 57, "prompt_tokens": 1581, "total_tokens": 1638, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.474, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "浅底，不是深底。", "evidence_ids": ["r10"]}}
{"id": "both-04", "kind": "both", "question": "每天目标多少公里？另一帧跑者是在室内还是操场一带？", "criterion": "每天 3 公里，截图是室外操场或草地一带。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 32.78, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:22", "start": 31.72, "text": "之前我也跑过", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r2": {"end": 33.86, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:23", "start": 32.78, "text": "而且不止一次", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r3": {"end": 36.6, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:24", "start": 33.86, "text": "只不过每一次都是跑了几天就不了了", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r4": {"end": 40.3, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:25", "start": 36.6, "text": "之所以这次我决定无论如何都要跑够100天", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r5": {"end": 41.24, "id": "43209985991:2141588366292954112:26", "start": 40.3, "text": "每天3km", "cid": "43209985991"}, "r6": {"id": "43209985991:storyboard:54:278e89d275a52bfe", "cid": "43209985991", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 288.0, "end": 288.0}}, "text": "{\"action\": \"reply_public\", \"reason\": \"specific_detail\", \"text\": \"跑者是在操场一带，不是室内。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"r6\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 1503, "total_tokens": 1544, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.065, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "跑者是在操场一带，不是室内。", "evidence_ids": ["r6"]}}
{"id": "both-05", "kind": "both", "question": "它想多看谁喜欢的内容？第一格页面主色又是什么？", "criterion": "对方或用户喜欢的内容，深色界面。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 47.279, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:18", "start": 45.019, "text": "也就是他分享给你的视频", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r2": {"end": 49.659, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:19", "start": 47.279, "text": "你有没有去看他艾特你的评论呢", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r3": {"end": 50.299, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:20", "start": 49.659, "text": "你有没有回", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r4": {"end": 52.139, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:21", "start": 50.299, "text": "或者他有没有给他评论点赞", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r5": {"end": 54.9, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:22", "start": 52.139, "text": "来调整他看视频的策略", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r6": {"end": 57.32, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:23", "start": 54.9, "text": "他会更加倾向于去看你感兴趣的", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r7": {"end": 58.94, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:24", "start": 57.32, "text": "或者说你喜欢的那种视频啊", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r8": {"end": 60.75, "id": "42838132685:2132116805014462720:25", "start": 58.94, "text": "用来迎合你的喜好嘛", "cid": "42838132685"}, "r9": {"id": "42838132685:storyboard:44:b084bc8810710587", "cid": "42838132685", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 222.0, "end": 222.0}}, "text": "{\n\"action\": \"wait\",\n\"reason\": \"insufficient_evidence\",\n\"text\": \"\",\n\"evidence_ids\": []\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 1580, "total_tokens": 1617, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.894, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "wait", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "text": "", "evidence_ids": []}}
{"id": "both-06", "kind": "both", "question": "字幕说哪代同容量更便宜？游戏截图有几路横向对比？", "criterion": "DDR4，同屏三路。", "allowed": ["r1", "r10", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 35.14, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:18", "start": 33.14, "text": "就是被D5内存的价格拖了后腿", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r2": {"end": 36.6, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:19", "start": 35.14, "text": "虽然内存开始涨价以来", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r3": {"end": 38.28, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:20", "start": 36.6, "text": "不管是DDR4还是DDR5", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r4": {"end": 39.96, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:21", "start": 38.28, "text": "都是一个持续发癫状态", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r5": {"end": 41.48, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:22", "start": 39.96, "text": "涨幅都高达百分之几百", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r6": {"end": 42.32, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:23", "start": 41.48, "text": "但总的来说", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r7": {"end": 45.46, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:24", "start": 42.32, "text": "DDR4的同容量价格还是显著低于DDR5", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r8": {"end": 47.14, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:25", "start": 45.46, "text": "这也是大家低预算装机时", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r9": {"end": 49.08, "id": "38875041001:2090367372803756800:26", "start": 47.14, "text": "更倾向于选择D4平台的原因", "cid": "38875041001"}, "r10": {"id": "38875041001:storyboard:66:24cd00bbef9aa32d", "cid": "38875041001", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 396.0, "end": 396.0}}, "text": "{\n\"action\": \"wait\",\n\"reason\": \"insufficient_evidence\",\n\"text\": \"\",\n\"evidence_ids\": []\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 1602, "total_tokens": 1638, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.084, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "wait", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "text": "", "evidence_ids": []}}
{"id": "both-07", "kind": "both", "question": "字幕说还缺什么？截图中能不能看到已经放着的箱子？", "criterion": "还缺几个大箱子和麦田，画面里已有箱子。两条并不冲突。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 30.62, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:12", "start": 29.12, "text": "头胸腿靴都是钻石的", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r2": {"end": 32.54, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:13", "start": 30.62, "text": "家里还差几个大箱子和一块麦田", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r3": {"end": 34.12, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:14", "start": 32.54, "text": "我先去砍树", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r4": {"end": 46.02, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:15", "start": 43.22, "text": "哎呀卧槽我要回家啊", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r5": {"end": 49.14, "id": "42956949203:2135057381217398784:16", "start": 46.02, "text": "卧槽回来了", "cid": "42956949203"}, "r6": {"id": "42956949203:storyboard:24:1aeb62a5bbb8d2fb", "cid": "42956949203", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 128.0, "end": 128.0}}, "text": "{\n\"action\": \"wait\",\n\"reason\": \"insufficient_evidence\",\n\"text\": \"\",\n\"evidence_ids\": []\n}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 1508, "total_tokens": 1545, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1042}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.347, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "wait", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "text": "", "evidence_ids": []}}
